  "cloudChannelsNote": "OpenList, WebDAV, Quark Drive (experimental), and the system document picker for OneDrive, Google Drive, and similar services. Channels are entry points only; no accounts or credentials are built in, and real authorization and file access are frozen in static delivery.",
