  "wenkuFormatsNote": "Formats now match the reference project: TXT, EPUB, MOBI, AZW, AZW3, PRC, FB2, PDF, DOC, DOCX, RTF, HTML, Markdown, and ZIP. Legacy binary formats are registered as routes only in static delivery; their decoders stay frozen.",
