  "wenkuEndpointNote": "URLs are built only in the site adapter. No official page-structure docs are public, so path templates must be checked against the live site.",
  "wenkuChallengeNote": "The source asks for an access check. Please finish it on the Wenku8 website; this app does not bypass verification.",
